    "problemName": "design-most-recently-used-queue",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class MRUQueue:\r\n    def __init__(self, n: int):\r\n        self.q = list(range(1, n + 1))\r\n\r\n    def fetch(self, k: int) -> int:\r\n        ans = self.q[k - 1]\r\n        self.q[k - 1 : k] = []\r\n        self.q.append(ans)\r\n        return ans\r\n\r\n\r\n# Your MRUQueue object will be instantiated and called as such:\r\n# obj = MRUQueue(n)\r\n# param_1 = obj.fetch(k)",
